{"h":2857,"lines":[{"x":0.08108090051360671,"y":0.05711429152688674,"h":0.01632615016672978,"c":1,"w":0.1060153071085612,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"t":"TAMMY:","c":1,"h":0.012003445475146535,"x":0.079521752642543048,"w":0.048568951288859047,"y":0.10737037026559082},{"t":"PAUL:","x":0.079584774322343621,"y":0.12354651141259387,"w":0.036332181294759097,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"TAMMY:","y":0.17151162805953113,"w":0.04844290733337403,"x":0.079584774620510224,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"y":0.18604651162905639,"w":0.034602076212565114,"t":"PAUL:","h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"x":0.081314879194755482},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.050173009236653632,"t":"TAMMY:","c":1,"x":0.079584775571984595,"y":0.20203488382086765},{"y":0.21802325559711044,"w":0.036332181294759111,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","x":0.079584774318018373},{"y":0.24999999979222354,"x":0.079584775571984595,"t":"TAMMY:","h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.050173009236653632,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.079584774318018373,"y":0.26598837187618019,"w":0.036332181294759111,"t":"PAUL:"},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.31395348816431656,"x":0.079584774623714105,"w":0.04844290733337403,"t":"TAMMY:"},{"c":1,"x":0.16435986311946252,"y":0.10461861446776366,"w":0.20242214202880857,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"Oh, the kids would love that!"},{"t":"One other thing. We arrived in Aberdeen hours before the ferry was due to","y":0.12063953495667457,"c":1,"x":0.16435987105218697,"w":0.52595153808593753,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.01615721700573558,"c":1,"t":"leave so we decided to go somewhere else rather than hang around at the port","x":0.16262976843661231,"y":0.13645906198284563,"w":0.55709340413411468},{"t":"Where did you go?","h":0.016139925402140154,"x":0.16435986196717786,"w":0.13667819976806642,"y":0.16860465123001001,"c":1},{"h":0.01599475868604161,"c":1,"t":"Drum Castle.","x":0.16411890000967844,"y":0.18325835829679782,"w":0.09573970794677733},{"w":0.37716262817382812,"y":0.20048985305624245,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"I've never heard of it. Is that spelt like the instrument?","c":1,"x":0.16435986229716898},{"x":0.16435987223696902,"w":0.55709340413411457,"c":1,"t":"Yeah. It's really worth visiting. It's got an impressive tower and beautiful gardens","y":0.2165697675168663,"h":0.016110428235512564},{"x":0.1643598594017909,"c":1,"w":0.16089965820312499,"h":0.013081395100512871,"y":0.23255813965097094,"t":"and ancient woodland."},{"c":1,"w":0.28719724019368487,"t":"Sounds lovely. Does it have a restaurant?","x":0.16435985732530289,"y":0.24842547216767119,"h":0.014695591322603341},{"h":0.016134840028948494,"c":1,"t":"It's only got a coffee shop - no restaurant. We looked up restaurants in the area","y":0.26308139541793407,"w":0.55363321940104171,"x":0.16435986093556834},{"y":0.27906976715967324,"c":1,"h":0.01744186102384615,"w":0.55536331176757814,"t":"and found an Italian one in a village nearby. I can check the name of it for you if","x":0.1643598665238547},{"h":0.014447202208661136,"c":1,"x":0.16418684413372417,"w":0.12657254536946613,"t":"you're interested.","y":0.295252043730444},{"y":0.30965429561697189,"t":"Oh thanks Paul that would be ....","h":0.016098086528631206,"x":0.16424357133723788,"w":0.23209325154622396,"c":1},{"t":"PART 2","h":0.016281214020650969,"x":0.081276801580236702,"w":0.086581344604492183,"y":0.36177218332091576,"c":1},{"y":0.39083275009500174,"c":1,"x":0.083044990079697997,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"Good evening everyone. My name's Jon and I run Veg Out, a street food business selling"},{"t":"vegan food. Since 2012 I've been travelling all around the country cooking vegan food in","y":0.40692792134152689,"w":0.61937718709309897,"x":0.079584762769180292,"h":0.016095171448565537,"c":1},{"t":"my converted van and selling it at all kinds of outdoor events. I'm here to give you some","x":0.083044972873710543,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"w":0.61245676676432304,"y":0.4229651160414527},{"x":0.081198162269118232,"c":1,"h":0.014902002749699994,"y":0.43829546540438735,"t":"advice based on my experience.","w":0.22693822224934895},{"t":"The good news is that there's never been a better time to start your own street food","y":0.46220930209037081,"w":0.58823527018229171,"h":0.01469762613925174,"c":1,"x":0.081314890783645094},{"c":1,"x":0.081314890647713203,"t":"business. Street food continues to grow in popularity. I think there are a couple of reasons","y":0.47819767445623507,"w":0.62629755655924479,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"x":0.07958476593249382,"t":"for this. The first is that street food is a reaction against fast food. Street food ranges from","y":0.49405178472619471,"w":0.62802769978841144,"c":1,"h":0.016122633798544506},{"t":"high quality burgers to vegan curries and everything in between. But while fast food is","x":0.08131487995099855,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.60034601847330737,"y":0.51014695566243429},{"c":1,"y":0.52616279077034112,"h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.60899653116861974,"x":0.079584779252077784,"t":"cheap and easy to find, it's not particularly good for you. It's also the same everywhere."},{"t":"What you get with street food on the other hand is something different. People like the","y":0.54198740383862365,"h":0.016152130965172096,"x":0.081314874844071738,"w":0.61418685913085946,"c":1},{"x":0.079584763368736308,"c":1,"w":0.63494812011718749,"y":0.55808257544214512,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"idea of trying something they can't get anywhere else. They also like seeing food prepared"},{"t":"in front of them and which hasn't come straight out of a freezer.","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.57412790674065162,"c":1,"x":0.07958477569732679,"w":0.44636678059895829},{"c":1,"y":0.59727081904594181,"w":0.62629755655924479,"x":0.079584785687555906,"h":0.016101273896395596,"t":"You need to think about the best place to sell your street food. People always think music"},{"w":0.60207611083984369,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.081314885670292797,"y":0.61336599034052719,"t":"festivals are an obvious place to start but the cost of renting a space can be huge. And"},{"t":"there's always a lot of competition. Food markets, on the other hand, are great because","w":0.61591695149739589,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.62936046488080311,"x":0.081314880541374299},{"x":0.079584783115993457,"y":0.64520643815796541,"h":0.016130771063023186,"c":1,"w":0.63321797688802073,"t":"customers are always really interested in food and give great feedback. And if you can get"},{"t":"a spot in your local park - fantastic. Usually very relaxed but with lots of customers passing","x":0.079584777380419497,"y":0.66130160976303198,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.63148788452148441,"c":1},{"w":0.62283737182617183,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.67732558147041233,"t":"by. Once you get established you'll start getting asked to do parties - which can be really","x":0.081314878010130376},{"t":"challenging but lots of fun. Having street food at weddings has become quite fashionable","c":1,"x":0.079584779928114385,"y":0.69314205762903314,"w":0.62456746419270837,"h":0.014706779810996884},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"x":0.079584785034209349,"w":0.61072662353515628,"t":"too - but you need to really know what you're doing as everything needs to be perfect.","y":0.70923722887536544},{"t":"Setting up a street food business costs a lot less than opening a restaurant or café but you'll","w":0.64195312500000001,"h":0.019016734364151189,"x":0.079542316218045334,"y":0.74998655693417149,"c":1},{"w":0.6350578308105469,"c":1,"t":"have to buy some basic equipment. I'd try to get things like hobs and fridges second hand","h":0.018179960898205172,"x":0.079536611304701244,"y":0.76672654178462663},{"w":0.62975779215494798,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"x":0.07958477180850404,"t":"if you can. You can replace them with better quality stuff if your business takes off. Renting","y":0.78341497548352179},{"x":0.081314886372638284,"w":0.54844289143880209,"y":0.80087209278812233,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"is another option but you'll end up spending more money rather than saving it."},{"h":0.018920961170450168,"c":1,"t":"You've probably got a good idea about the food you're planning to sell. I expect you've","x":0.079549021639891512,"y":0.82261444334725353,"w":0.61253306070963542},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.081314886282210494,"c":1,"y":0.84009797046678381,"t":"done some research to find out if anyone else is selling a similar product. And you'll have","w":0.61764704386393221},{"x":0.07958478053991859,"y":0.85610465123812085,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"t":"thought about any possible allergies to nuts or eggs etc. But there's one thing people don't","w":0.64013839721679688},{"y":0.87193841864281574,"t":"always think about and that's how you're going to serve it. On a plate? In a bag? Will you","w":0.6211072794596354,"h":0.016142976626055128,"c":1,"x":0.079584768484848217},{"x":0.081314878635218968,"y":0.88803358993644899,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.63840830485026046,"t":"provide a fork? Will it all be easily recyclable or reusable? It's got to be easy to eat and look"},{"t":"attractive or customers won't come back.","c":1,"x":0.081314880524187977,"w":0.28892733256022141,"y":0.90406976724443633,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"x":0.08131487870825356,"t":"108","h":0.014534882851794828,"c":1,"y":0.95494186071799791,"w":0.031141869227091487},{"c":1,"x":0.74567474021483315,"t":"09","y":0.18604651170175612,"w":0.024221453666687043,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"t":"Q10","c":1,"y":0.28052325590177851,"x":0.745674740353925,"w":0.034602076212565058,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"t":"Q11\/12","c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.54360465090492649,"x":0.74567474095592579,"w":0.058823528289794869},{"t":"Q11\/12","y":0.55959302335887717,"w":0.058823528289794869,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.7456747409561183,"c":1},{"t":"Q13\/14","x":0.74555875190723764,"w":0.059055506388346335,"c":1,"y":0.63188980962372654,"h":0.013836659777823446},{"t":"Q13\/14","c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.7456747409561183,"y":0.64825581405655153,"w":0.058823528289794869},{"x":0.74394463655730836,"w":0.034602076212565058,"t":"Q15","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.77034883693612355,"c":1}],"w":2400}